===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ru|en}} {{m|ru|Коминте́рн}}, contracted abbreviation of {{m|ru|[[коммунистический|Коммуни́сти́ческий]] [[Интернациона́л]]||tr=Kommunístíčeskij Intɛrnacionál|Communist International}}, from {{m|ru|коммунисти́ческий}} + {{m|ru|Интернациона́л|tr=Intɛrnacionál}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˈkɒmɪntəːn/|lang=en}}

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# {{lb|en|historical}} An [[international]] [[association]] of [[Communist]] [[parties]], established in 1919 by Vladimir Lenin and dissolved in 1943.

